# BTC 1% Radar does not need an API key, secret, or account.
# Copying this file to .env is optional. The radar does not read it.
#
# BINANCE_FAPI_BASE and MACRO_CALENDAR_PATH are intentionally unused.
# The public host is fixed in code (https://fapi.binance.com) so a local
# environment file cannot retarget requests. The macro calendar ships at
# btc_radar/macro_events.json.
#
# If you later add an authenticated venue, put secrets in .env only.
# .env is gitignored. Never commit keys, and never paste them into issues.
